{
  "key": 9219,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_RageCandyBarsAreTooPopular",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Rowan: Hmm... Rage Candy Bars\n",
        "are too popular, it seems.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Professeur Sorbier: Hum... Les Bonbons\n",
        "Rage m’ont l’air très populaires.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_DoesLifeContinueToThrillYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, it’s you.\r",
        "Does life continue to thrill you?\n",
        "It does for me.\r",
        "For example, I recently discovered\n",
        "some Pokémon evolve only in certain\f",
        "locations.\r",
        "When I learned that, I felt thrilled!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, te voilà.\r",
        "La vie te réserve-t-elle toujours des\n",
        "surprises? A moi, oui, en tout cas.\r",
        "Par exemple, j’ai récemment découvert\n",
        "que certains Pokémon ne peuvent\f",
        "évoluer qu’à des endroits bien précis.\r",
        "Ça pour une surprise..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_BoughtAllRageCandyBars",
      "en_US": [
        "I didn’t expect to find paradise in the\n",
        "department store’s basement.\r",
        "I got carried away and bought up all\n",
        "the Rage Candy Bars!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je ne soupçonnais pas que le sous-sol\n",
        "du centre commercial était un paradis.\r",
        "J’ai été si emballé que j’ai acheté tout\n",
        "le stock de Bonbons Rage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_HopelessAtCookingPoffins",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m hopeless at cooking Poffins, so I\n",
        "buy them here.\r",
        "I wish I could feed my babies Poffins\n",
        "that I made myself, though."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis nulle en cuisine, alors je viens\n",
        "ici pour m’approvisionner en Poffins.\r",
        "Si seulement j’étais capable de faire\n",
        "moi-même les Poffins de mes chéris!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_FlavorsAffectCondition",
      "en_US": [
        "Pay attention, please.\r",
        "The flavors of Poffins affect the\n",
        "condition of Pokémon.\r",
        "Spicy Poffins enhance coolness.\r",
        "Dry Poffins enhance beauty.\r",
        "Sweet Poffins enhance cuteness.\r",
        "Bitter Poffins enhance smartness.\r",
        "And Sour Poffins enhance toughness.\r",
        "Sigh...\n",
        "Poffins are wonderful, aren’t they?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Votre attention, s’il vous plaît.\r",
        "Selon leur goût, les Poffins modifient\n",
        "diverses caractéristiques des Pokémon.\r",
        "Les Poffins Epicés augmentent\n",
        "le Sang-froid.\r",
        "Les Poffins Secs, la Beauté.\r",
        "Les Poffins Sucrés, la Grâce.\r",
        "Les Poffins Amers, l’Intelligence.\r",
        "Et les Poffins Acides, la Robustesse.\r",
        "Pfiou... Les Poffins sont formidables,\n",
        "n’est-ce pas?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_Welcome",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome to the basement--the food and\n",
        "produce section.\r",
        "We offer a fine and pleasing selection\n",
        "of Pokémon food and treats."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bienvenue au niveau -1, qui abrite le\n",
        "rayon alimentation.\r",
        "Découvrez notre vaste gamme de\n",
        "nourriture et friandises pour Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_WeHaveBerriesOnSale",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you ever planted Berries, then\n",
        "promptly forgotten about them?\r",
        "If that’s you, we have Berries on sale,\n",
        "too."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Vous est-il déjà arrivé d’oublier où\n",
        "vous aviez planté vos Baies?\r",
        "Si c’est le cas, jetez donc un œil à\n",
        "notre sélection de Baies."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_AllSoldOut",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello!\n",
        "Rage Candy Bars...\r",
        "I’m all sold out.\n",
        "I’m terribly sorry."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour!\n",
        "Je n’ai plus un seul Bonbon Rage\f",
        "en stock...\r",
        "Je suis confuse."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_WouldYouLikeSomeLavaCookies",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, there.\r",
        "Would you like some Lava Cookies?\n",
        "They’re $200 each."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Bonjour et bienvenue.\r",
        "Que diriez-vous de quelques Lava\n",
        "Cookies? C’est 200 $ pièce."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_OneLavaCookie",
      "en_US": [
        "Here you go, one Lava Cookie.\n",
        "Thank you."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Voilà votre Lava Cookie.\n",
        "Merci."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_TenLavaCookies",
      "en_US": [
        "Here you go, ten Lava Cookies.\n",
        "Thank you very much."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Voilà vos dix Lava Cookies.\n",
        "Merci beaucoup."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_NoMoreRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry, but you’ve got no more\n",
        "room."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis désolée mais vous n’avez plus\n",
        "de place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "VeilstoneStoreB1F_Text_LavaCookiesNotEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m sorry, but you don’t have enough\n",
        "money."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis désolée mais vous n’avez pas\n",
        "assez d’argent."
      ]
    },
    {
